    <h2>Selected Writing & Projects</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="/ideas/2025/ml-retro/">ML notes & interpretability readings</a>
        — a growing index of methods, papers, and experiments
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/ideas/2025/ml-a1/">Supervised learning study</a> — pipelines comparing
